ted_at":"2025-04-10T15:24:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T15:24:49Z","body":"@passivestar @lander-vr Could you give this PR a try when you have time?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2794229586/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795967674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-2795967674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":2795967674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mpxS6","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T06:33:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T06:33:40Z","body":"> Currently bound to V, open to suggestions. This can be changed to be anything by modifying shortcuts in the editor, in case people want this to be the option bound to Q.\r\n\r\nAssuming the idea for <kbd>V</kbd> came from 2D editors like Photoshop/Affinity it's worth noting that in those apps <kbd>V</kbd> is move mode (which is equivalent to transform mode of this PR, not select mode). For example <kbd>V</kbd> mode allows rotating in affinity:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"247\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edcdca95-929e-41f5-937b-ad05828521d8\" /><br>\r\n\r\n\r\nDoes 2D also need extra select mode? Right now 2D select mode moves nodes just like 3D transform mode. They probably should be consistent?\r\n\r\n> Currently bound to V\r\n\r\nSeems to be bound to Q btw, V doesn't work and I don't see the revert button in settings:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"377\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b416f540-57e3-475a-aa89-233910848ded\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795967674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797496186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-2797496186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":2797496186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mvmd6","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T17:00:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T17:18:41Z","body":">Assuming the idea for V came from 2D editors like Photoshop/Affinity it's worth noting that in those apps V is move mode (which is equivalent to transform mode of this PR, not select mode). For example V mode allows rotating in affinity:\r\n\r\nIt was mostly arbitrary based on what was available, I am completely open to suggestions on this.\r\n\r\n>Does 2D also need extra select mode? Right now 2D select mode moves nodes just like 3D transform mode. They probably should be consistent?\r\n\r\nI don't use 2D nearly as much as 3D, but I can say that the issues of not having a tool like this in 3D are vastly more pronounced and a legitimate usability issue. We'd have to get the opinions of people that use 2D a lot more to see if they'd want something like this. \r\n\r\n>Seems to be bound to Q btw, V doesn't work and I don't see the revert button in settings:\r\n\r\nThis is fixed (as long we keep `V` as a binding). This apparently affects the selection tool for game mode as well since it understandably uses the same shortcut.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797496186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196436114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-3196436114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":3196436114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-hb6S","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T12:17:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T12:17:05Z","body":"Rebasing after: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109465\r\n\r\nVerified that everything still works.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196436114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263854435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-3263854435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":3263854435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Cindj","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T15:34:23Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T15:34:23Z","body":"> Does 2D also need extra select mode?\r\n\r\n2D doesn't have full transform gizmo, so it doesn't have this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263854435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3296749045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-3296749045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":3296749045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EgGX1","user":{"login":"Rawalanche","id":38806207,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODA2MjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38806207?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche","html_url":"https://github.com/Rawalanche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T08:54:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T08:54:14Z","body":"Great to see this finally happening. I think it should be bound to Q since Godot defaults to W/E/R Move/Rotate/Scale hotkey standard, and W/E/R layout is usually complemented by Q being the select key, not multi-transform key. \r\n\r\nAs @passivestar mentioned, V is usually used for context-based transform tools in other software, so it would be an ideal candidate for the multi-transform mode, and Q would become the select mode.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3296749045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393972686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-3393972686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":3393972686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KS-nO","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-12T06:14:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-12T06:14:13Z","body":"Keeping select as `Q` makes sense to me especially with it being the current default for the game mode which does work as a regular select.\r\n\r\nI've switched the key for the new select mode to `Q` and transform mode to `V`. \r\n\r\nI've also moved the button for the transform tool to right of scale to keep the Q,W,E,R sequence, and it helps it look more visually distinct when not adjacent to the move tool.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"191\" height=\"57\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46eb82c7-a607-45e6-8971-652afec53f33\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393972686/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3553799175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168#issuecomment-3553799175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101168","id":3553799175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7T0qwH","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","f